<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Monday, Feb 17   used for cash settlement of CME</p>
<p>Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Monday	 Feb 17   $68.90    up 0.03</p>
<p>Friday	 Feb 14   $68.87    dn 0.11</p>
